OL,6,     FRuben Rada took Afro-Uruguayan
OL,7,     Fmusic to the world, and helped
OL,8,     Fpioneer the Candombe Beat genre.
OL,9,     FHe passed away in August aged 83.
OL,10,G0350 Witness History
OL,11,     FIn the summer of 1985, an Irish
OL,12,     Fvillage became the focus of a
OL,13,     Fnational phenomenon. Thousands
OL,14,     Ftravelled to Ballinspittle after
OL,15,     Freports that a statue of the
OL,16,     FVirgin Mary was moving.
